          "Copy the concrete details into a private note: deliverables, location or remote format, dates, expected time and the application route. Keep the original link and the date you read it. A screenshot can preserve wording, but store it privately if it includes personal contact details. If the call changes, a dated record helps you ask which version applies without relying on memory or a forwarded fragment."
