          "Check whether the request fits your boundaries and whether you can identify the responsible organization through its published channels. If someone changes the role in private messages, compare the new request with the original call. Pause when the scope, participants or intended use changes. A deadline does not require you to accept an unclear condition. Questions about agreements may need qualified advice before you make a commitment."
