          "Keep organizations separate on your question sheet. On x3STAR, the creator inquiry goes to Admin review, while partner applications follow separate providers’ processes. Public discovery, an inquiry and a confirmed booking are also different things. Write down which organization is responsible for each step. This keeps an answer from one provider from becoming an assumption about another provider with a similar button or description."
