          "For an illustrative comparison, suppose you want to publish a profile and take occasional remote assignments. You would ask whether the profile is public, how people contact you, whether a listing expires and what happens when you become unavailable. If you also need a way to deliver files, ask about that separately. Do not assume a site provides messaging, file storage or payment simply because it displays creator profiles."
