          "Find out what happens if a profile is displayed incorrectly, someone contacts you about a questionable request or an account becomes inaccessible. Note the support route and the information needed to open a useful request. Ask how you will receive important account notices. A promise that support is friendly leaves the response process unclear; a published route you can find again is more useful when you need to report a specific problem."
