          "Choose the part of the industry you are willing to support. You may prefer public introductions, interviews, promotional assets or administrative media. State your boundaries before accepting files, and ask for a description of the material and intended work. The other party should have enough information to avoid sending unsuitable content. A clear scope also helps you choose which portfolio samples are relevant to share."
