          "For a practice sample, you could turn a two-minute event announcement into a concise video and a shorter preview. Explain why you retained a particular sentence, how you made captions legible and what changed between the two versions. A potential client can then judge the thinking behind the cut. A long showreel with rapid excerpts may display variety but reveal little about your ability to follow a brief from beginning to end."
