          "For an illustrative collaboration, two creators might agree to a short non-explicit interview for their public portfolios. They would still need to discuss who edits it, which version each person reviews and whether either person wants to use a separate excerpt later. These are practical questions to resolve before recording. Where formal agreements or rights questions are involved, obtain appropriate advice instead of treating a conversational checklist as a complete agreement."
