          "Separate essential conditions from preferences. You may need a definite answer about working dates before you can continue, while a preferred review tool could be negotiable. Keep those distinctions in your private notes. Do not bring sensitive identity documents into a general introductory call or upload them to an unfamiliar meeting chat. Ask the responsible provider for its official process if verification is relevant to the next stage."
