          "You can acknowledge a break without publishing its private reasons. A practical update can state that you are reviewing selected projects from a given period and explain the best contact route. Avoid announcing broad availability before checking your capacity. People who remember your earlier schedule may assume it still applies unless you provide a clear current version."
