          "Update profiles and availability once you know what you can sustain. Close obsolete posts so they do not compete with the new description. You can continue with a limited workload, move toward supporting roles or extend the preparation period. Make the next commitment from current evidence and your present preferences. There is no requirement to turn a return into an immediate full schedule."
