          "An illustrative newsletter kit might include the current subscriber count and the reporting period for recent editions, if the publisher can document them. It should not imply that every subscriber opens every message or that a past click count predicts a sponsor’s outcome. You can build a useful kit with a small audience by explaining the topic focus and showing representative work. Size alone does not explain the proposed relationship."
