          "Confirm the destination’s current capabilities, terms and participation requirements before relying on it. Account creation, approval and practical readiness can be separate stages. Do not close an existing route merely because a new application was received. If an essential function is still unconfirmed, keep that uncertainty visible in your plan. On x3STAR, a creator inquiry starts Admin review and does not by itself establish a booked assignment or an activated production service."
