          "Note where each item lives, what format it uses and how you will check the copy. A folder existing in the new location does not prove that its files open correctly. Keep originals separate from a working copy while testing. If a provider limits exports, document the limitation and ask its official support route about available options. Avoid unapproved scraping or a hurried workaround that creates a new data-handling problem."
