          "In an illustrative portfolio move, you could prepare a new page with three approved samples while leaving the old public link in place. Test the page on a phone and ask a reviewer to find your service description and contact information. Correct access errors before directing people to it. This trial reveals the practical work needed for the full move without putting every active enquiry through an unfinished page."
