          "If you announce the move, state exactly what changed and what remains available. Invite people to use the new public contact route without transferring private messages or mailing lists beyond the permission you have. Check how the old service handles account closure, outstanding records and public page removal. Record the steps you actually completed rather than treating an intention to leave as a finished closure."
