          "Retain a recovery path that fits the provider’s terms and your agreements. You might keep a private archive and a known working portfolio copy while the new route settles. Protect that archive and review whether it contains information you no longer need. Once the move is verified, remove obsolete links and close the tasks in your plan. Revisit the reason for moving after a defined working period and compare the new workflow with that original need."
